honoring six decades of educating valley  students with a musical tribute in  today's what's cool at school  las vegas day school was founded by jack  and helen dossler in 1961 with  27 students in a one-room rented  schoolhouse  six decades later the school educates  800 kids a year on a 17-acre campus  it was time to celebrate  students paid tribute to the school's  60th anniversary with a virtual and  vocal thank you  [Music]  led by their musical theater director 40  students spanning across grades saying  some things never change from frozen two  all of a sudden they come out of their  shells and  i'm just amazed every time i do an  audition at how  many kids are just little  stars in the making it made me feel  really  happy that it's all together or it's  like  kind of like a wholesome feeling and my  classmates were really excited  and we're all getting older and wiser  that's why we  rely on certain certainties  the goal was to honor how lvds has  persevered through a pandemic  and also thrived through 60 years in las  vegas  educating thousands i also wanted the  children the kids that were  actually doing the singing to understand  the importance of  how special it was for  us to have come all of this way it also  gave  musical theater kids who have been  silenced and sidelined for a full  calendar year to sing out this was so  special too because  i hadn't had a chance all year to see  any of my musical theater kids  and so this was a great opportunity for  us to  you know let them use their creative  side it's so important  i really love all the work that goes  into it at the end  i love how everyone kind of joins  together  and i just really love doing it it's  kind of one of my passions  being a musical theater teacher isn't  about creating more  singers and dancers in the world it's  about creating a more well-rounded  child the reaction beyond expectations  well i got lots and lots of thank yous  and  you know lots of tears and and  and everyone's just so joyful  you know i think that teachers  especially  um took it to heart  [Music]  and that's what's cool at school if you  know something that's cool at school  head to eight news now dot com click on  cool at school under the community tab  or send your email to cool at school at  eight newsnow dot com
 

